{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>You have brought up</b> — three times. And the others: \"the Egyptians will hear that You brought up in Your might\"; \"You have brought up my soul from Sheol.\" This teaches that the subjugation of the exiles is weighed against Gehinnom, and this is \"You brought up from the land of Egypt\" = \"You have brought up my soul from Sheol.\""], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:59.778377947Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}